## I. Recap of Trivia

### A. Requirements : [Trivia Requirements](https://netorgft8913976-my.sharepoint.com/:w:/g/personal/may%5Fmagdy%5Fgrinta-group%5Fcom/Eb3%5F3Kxq7rZKlQKYkxxdrbEBBqzMCZ%5FGsehXwIJbV7H6Vw?e=cTemsY&nav=eyJoIjoiMTkyOTAxOTAwOCJ9) \[Pages 45 - 48\]

### B. Design and implementation : 

####   
Entry point

* Trivia entry point is through the win tab
* Screen data and games are received through the “Get Games” API
* Selected game check for the user type access and the coins threshold
* If user pass the type access, “Get User Game” API is then called to check if the user already played this game or not. In case the user already played this game a pop up is displayed

APIs used in this screen :   
Get Games   
Get User Game 

---

* “Get Game” API is called in this screen to draw the screen and save the game data moving into the beginning of the game
* A check is made if the game has a promo code in this case it navigates to the promo code screen shown below, if not the user moves directly into the game
* In the promo code screen, the user enters a promo code and the API “Validate Promo Code” is used to ensure the validity of the user’s promo code

APIs used in these screens :   
Get Game 

Validate Promo Code 

---

#### Game start

* The game then start with a set of 5 questions that the user should answer successfully
* In case of success or failure an API “Submit User Game” is called to submit the result of the user

Submit User Game 

---

#### Game end

* The user is then directed to the win or lose screens and no APIs are called here, just static screens

