## II. Recap of Gift Game

### A. Requirements : [Trivia Requirements](https://netorgft8913976-my.sharepoint.com/:w:/g/personal/may%5Fmagdy%5Fgrinta-group%5Fcom/Eb3%5F3Kxq7rZKlQKYkxxdrbEBBqzMCZ%5FGsehXwIJbV7H6Vw?e=cTemsY&nav=eyJoIjoiMTkyOTAxOTAwOCJ9) \[Pages 38 - 45\]

### B. Design and implementation : 

#### Entry point

* Gift game entry point is through home cards, no APIs calls related to the gift game is called in home. The card just redirects to the beginning gift game flow passing only the game ID that is presented in the payload of the card in the homepage

---

* In this screen at first an API called is made “Get Subscription Gift Game By ID” to acquire the game and the necessary details needed to draw the screen (i.e. images and descriptions)
* Another API call “Get Subscription Gift User Games” is made upon clicking on the “continue” button which retrieve the Gift Game Result, to check eligibility cases, if the user played this game before and if he/she already redeemed the gift

Get Subscription Gift Game By Id 

Get Subscription Gift User Games 

---

#### Game Sets

* A screen that draw the available sets of the gift game, upon selecting the user get redirected to the game start screen with the game id and the set id to start the game

---

#### Game start

* The game then start with a set of 5 questions that the user should answer successfully
* In case of success or failure an API “Submit User Subscription Game Result” is called to submit the result of the user

Submit User Subscription Game Result 

---

#### Game end

* The end game has multiple scenarios :  
A. The user wins and eligible to redeem a gift  
B. The user loses and the game has a game over gift  
C. The user loses and the game has no game over gift  
D. The user didn’t choose an answer, time is up and the game has a game over gift  
E. The user didn’t choose an answer, time is up and the game has no game over gift
* In case of gift redeem an API is called “Redeem Subscription Game Gift” and user is redirected to the gift code screen upon API succession

Redeem Subscription Game Gift 

---

#### Gift Redeem

* The gift code screen display the code that the user redeemed and it has multiple cases :  
A. Gift code displayed and the user can redeem it on certain store that is stated in the title and description presented in the Game Set model  
B. Gift code available, displayed and an external usage link is presented for the user  
C. Gift code is unavailable and is not displayed to the user

